### Other updates

- **`classifyOfflineKillForcePostureTimeout`**: all new `…-control-*` stages are in `goOfflineClickStallStages` so they still map to **`offline-kill-force-posture-go-offline-click-stalled`** before the generic `endsWith('-done')` branch.  
- **CI console**: second line **`offline-kill-go-offline-harness-control-substage`** with the six `*Done` booleans.  
- **`governance/source_manifest.json`**: refreshed via `node scripts/update-source-manifest-hashes.js`.

A rerun that used to stop at **`…-control-resolve-start`** with **`click-not-attempted`** should now stop on a concrete **`…-control-*-start`** and report e.g. **`offline-kill-go-offline-control-visible-wait-stalled`** if `waitForSelector` is what hung.

